#: includes/class-email-countdown-timer-data-settings.php:113
msgid ""
"Apache must allow the Require directive in .htaccess. nginx ignores "
".htaccess and needs a host-managed location rule. Writing these files does "
"not verify protection: ask your host to check that direct GET and HEAD font "
"requests are denied while timer images still work. No remote probe is "
"performed."
msgstr ""
"Apache debe permitir la directiva Require en .htaccess. nginx ignora "
".htaccess y necesita una regla de ubicación administrada por el host. "
"Escribir estos archivos no verifica la protección: solicite a su host que "
"verifique que las solicitudes directas de fuentes GET y HEAD sean rechazadas"
" mientras las imágenes del temporizador aún funcionen. No se realiza ninguna"
" sonda remota."

